{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pao Pao",
    "steam_appid": 3024130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2a58f6796e4ff5fbe9e50c106218e087.avif?t=1755500466\" width=600 height=124 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Pao Pao</strong> is a fun co-op simulator and sandbox for 1\u20134 players, where cats, foxes, raccoons, and other furry characters throw down a true culinary fest. Manage your own restaurant by fishing for fresh ingredients and hustling to complete orders before your hungry customers scatter! Don\u2019t waste a second\u2014go solo or rally your crew to conquer mini-games, explore the vibrant night city after a hard day\u2019s work, and boost your business to a level every dog would envy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/865b16dd82177c78c95a512a73e8f527.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/865b16dd82177c78c95a512a73e8f527.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/865b16dd82177c78c95a512a73e8f527.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Culinary Chaos:</strong><br>Expand and level up your restaurant as you rack up achievements. Start with a modest kitchen and gradually add greenhouses, aquariums, and extra space. Daytime is a nonstop rush of orders, while nighttime offers a chance to kick back or prep for a brand-new day.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/dc100e2ab45461e861ef10c92ba3113b.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/dc100e2ab45461e861ef10c92ba3113b.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/dc100e2ab45461e861ef10c92ba3113b.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open World:</strong><br>Step into a unique, semi-open city bursting with opportunities\u2014snag awesome bonuses and dive into quests along the way. Sprint through the streets, meet quirky NPCs with exciting tasks and hot deals, and enjoy fun mini-games that help level up your biz. Keep expanding and brace yourself for constant surprises and dynamic challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong><br>In Pao Pao, your look is entirely up to you. Choose your totem animal\u2014from a cow to a wolf\u2014and rock a skin that shows off your creative and entrepreneurial flair. Whether you're into a strict chef\u2019s hat or a goofy bandana with paws, mix and match details to create a unique style that perfectly complements your culinary epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/6501f9602cfb293bc0fd90b2654bf803.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/6501f9602cfb293bc0fd90b2654bf803.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/6501f9602cfb293bc0fd90b2654bf803.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle:</strong><br>Mornings are for fishing, hitting up the shops, and catching up with friends, while nights bring a sudden calm. You can quietly explore your restaurant or hit the sack to fast-forward to a new day\u2014and score a bonus speed boost while you're at it. Every week, you get a restaurant bill: the higher your rating, the sweeter the rewards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/64663e7eac8acfe2093edd846f646261.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/64663e7eac8acfe2093edd846f646261.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/64663e7eac8acfe2093edd846f646261.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong><br>Every task comes with its own mini-game\u2014catch the moment, hit the right buttons, and keep an eye on the indicators. Whether you\u2019re cooking or fishing, every action demands your active participation. The further you progress, the trickier the challenges become, so there\u2019s never a dull moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2dc0d23c14d27b2d9ec6ca57007456aa.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2dc0d23c14d27b2d9ec6ca57007456aa.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2dc0d23c14d27b2d9ec6ca57007456aa.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests:</strong><br>Imagine getting an email from city hall inviting a VIP guest, and you need to level up your place ASAP to impress them. Or dive into a culinary battle where you must include a mandatory ingredient within a time limit\u2014the top chef earns a prestigious diploma that boosts reputation and draws in new customers. Our quests are designed to spice up your gameplay and keep the fun rolling.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/c1dfbc3851cf4008a95d0a56bfcd5f55.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/c1dfbc3851cf4008a95d0a56bfcd5f55.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/c1dfbc3851cf4008a95d0a56bfcd5f55.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen is heating up, and there's no turning back! If you're confident in your skills, dive headfirst into the animal mayhem and prove that you\u2019re absolutely Pao-tastic!<br><br>Contact us:\u00a0<strong>pr@games.artdock.studio</strong>\u00a0</p>",
