s, and catching up with friends, while nights bring a sudden calm. You can quietly explore your restaurant or hit the sack to fast-forward to a new day\u2014and score a bonus speed boost while you're at it. Every week, you get a restaurant bill: the higher your rating, the sweeter the rewards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/64663e7eac8acfe2093edd846f646261.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/64663e7eac8acfe2093edd846f646261.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/64663e7eac8acfe2093edd846f646261.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong><br>Every task comes with its own mini-game\u2014catch the moment, hit the right buttons, and keep an eye on the indicators. Whether you\u2019re cooking or fishing, every action demands your active participation. The further you progress, the trickier the challenges become, so there\u2019s never a dull moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2dc0d23c14d27b2d9ec6ca57007456aa.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2dc0d23c14d27b2d9ec6ca57007456aa.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/2dc0d23c14d27b2d9ec6ca57007456aa.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests:</strong><br>Imagine getting an email from city hall inviting a VIP guest, and you need to level up your place ASAP to impress them. Or dive into a culinary battle where you must include a mandatory ingredient within a time limit\u2014the top chef earns a prestigious diploma that boosts reputation and draws in new customers. Our quests are designed to spice up your gameplay and keep the fun rolling.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/c1dfbc3851cf4008a95d0a56bfcd5f55.poster.avif?t=1755500466\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/c1dfbc3851cf4008a95d0a56bfcd5f55.webm?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024130/extras/c1dfbc3851cf4008a95d0a56bfcd5f55.mp4?t=1755500466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen is heating up, and there's no turning back! If you're confident in your skills, dive headfirst into the animal mayhem and prove that you\u2019re absolutely Pao-tastic!<br><br>Contact us:\u00a0<strong>pr@games.artdock.studio</strong>\u00a0</p>",
